ate within fixed methodological parameters. They do not demonstrate autonomous revision of …", "title": "Limitations of Automated Epistemic Self-Correction"}, {"id": "nb-emergent-prefs-001", "project": "proj-emergent-prefs-001", "provenance": ["source-d8e6a4e1139d42cd", "source-d9addfec171d4b5d", "source-fae5034da1e04868"], "revision": 6, "summary": "Empirical survey data from athletes reveals a serial association model linking AI training recommendation dependence to body signal outsourcing, reduced self-regulation, training decision hesitation, and diminished self-efficacy.", "title": "Revised AI Dependency and Reduced Autonomy in Athletes"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "1f823cb701d69fb65c82414739b663d87fba380f4a0b46c49a4ec595b74343b6", "hash": "846c770ae655015d086e6c0a276d4311f4b9da589cf421933b4c16bcdc269619"}, {"seq": 1680, "time": "2026-10-23T19:50:17.474285+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 42486, "provider_input_hash": "19eccc58796c83d78e28c85a62dd1c91fedbc75888f18b01922e794f04fd2c93", "result": "unknown"}, "id": "w-aae17524d52a4586"}, "prev_hash": "846c770ae655015d086e6c0a276d4311f4b9da589cf421933b4c16bcdc269619", "hash": "3ea09ae417755875bbe659e78923fcda46deb11b4612e382ba6552dc11bc9ee9"}, {"seq": 1681, "time": "2026-10-23T19:52:19.309692+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_finished", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_call_made": false, "provider_input_chars": 42486, "provider_input_hash": "19eccc58796c83d78e28c85a62dd1c91fedbc75888f18b01922e794f04fd2c93", "result": "daily_quota", "retry_after_seconds": 39761.09987282753}, "id": "w-aae17524d52a4586"}, "prev_hash": "3ea09ae417755875bbe659e789